# "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact or creature" (CR 118.8, 601.2b): with neither on the
# battlefield Fanatical Offering is not castable (refused with both Swamps untapped), and once Bot1 has an Ornithopter
# (an artifact creature) it is. On turn 5 the second Offering sacrifices the Map token the first one made, a token
# being an artifact, and makes a new Map; the old one is gone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Fanatical Offering
Fanatical Offering
Ornithopter
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Fanatical Offering.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fanatical Offering.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Fanatical Offering; Ornithopter
? Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 3
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fanatical Offering.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Map Token)
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Fanatical Offering; Fanatical Offering; Ornithopter
